WEBVTT

NOTE Web version: narration as subtitles. Timing follows the transcript panels.

00:05.100 --> 00:16.800
In early 2020 in Chile, the pace of life was not yet set
by productivity demands driven by artificial intelligence.

00:16.800 --> 00:24.400
Even so, we already lived immersed in accelerated consumption
and the longing for immediacy.

00:24.400 --> 00:36.200
In early 2020 in Chile, we were not fully aware that
we were in free fall towards a climate collapse
fuelled by industrialisation and comfort.

00:37.000 --> 00:51.000
In early 2020 in Chile, the arrival of the coronavirus, its rapid spread
and its mortality forced extreme measures
such as quarantines and home isolation.

00:51.000 --> 01:00.300
In early 2020 in Chile, it was precisely that confinement
that first made us aware
of the anthropogenic noise we had ignored before.
